        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 71000ECB, Solid Brass Patio Door Trim Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic styling of Omnia's 71000 series multipoint trim grants it an elegance that is only enhanced through the addition of one of the beautiful lever design options--all of which are just as sophisticated as the patio trim itself. These solid brass leversets are for use with European Cylinder Below Lever (european profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Thru-Bolts</b> are fixed at 8-1/2\" center to center and can not be modified. In some cases new thru-bolting holes must be drilled in your door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced. The multipoint trim set is intended to replace the original trim from Hoppe, Hurd, JELD-WEN, Kolbe & Kolbe, Lincoln, Loewen, Peachtree, Norco, Semco, Vetter, Weathershield, Therma-Tru, Willmar, Sierra Pacific, KFV, Simpson, Signature, Crestline, Windsor and others. The <b>Lock to Lever</b> distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74477-SM.jpg?v=1704354552\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"71000ECB Multipoint Trim Sets dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Arched Patio Trim <a href=\"/products/arched-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-71000acb\">with <b>American Cylinder Below</b> the lever</a> and <a href=\"/products/arched-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-71000aca\">with <b>American Cylinder Above</b> the lever</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Omnia 71000ECB Multipoint Trim Sets\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass Trim</li>\r\n<li>Lock to Lever Spacing: 3-5/8\" (92 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Thru-Bolt Hole Spacing: 8-1/2\"  (216 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 9-5/8\" (244 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-3/4\" (44 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 1/2\" (12.5 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
