                "description": "Omnia 71000ECB European Cylinder Below - The classic styling of Omnia's 71000 series multipoint trim grants it an elegance that is only enhanced through the addition of one of the beautiful lever design options--all of which are just as sophisticated as the patio trim itself. These solid brass leversets are for use with European Cylinder Below Lever (european profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors. Available in 4 finishes.",
